<title>USA: TABLE-Fed Reserve business loans rose July 16 wk.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fed Reserve business loans rose July 16 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JULY 16</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............821,300 up.....2,800</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......722,100 down..10,500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......594,800 down...4,600</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....872,043 up.....1,108</p>
<p> Financial companies.......672,875 down...2,496</p>
<p> New York business loans....47,078 up.......661</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,799 up.......657</p>
</text>
